ontaining the `.manifest` file as the bundle root, even","+when that directory is nested below the provided path. Files outside of that","+directory are not part of the bundle. `opa build` and `opa sign` warn about any","+policy or data files they leave out, but other commands (e.g., `opa eval`,","+`opa run`, `opa test`) do not. A bundle directory must not contain manifests in","+more than one directory, so keep other `.manifest` files (e.g., in test","+fixtures) out of directories that you load as bundles.","+","+Bundle tarballs must have the `.manifest` file at the root of the archive, which"],"additions":25,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":398,"deletions":67,"truncated":true,"file_count":8},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-31T14:36:17.378988+00:00"}